Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.789 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  american actor kelsey grammer most  famous for portraying dr frazier crane  in the long-running series frasier has  lived a life full of ups and downs  we're here to give you a look at some of  the most tragic events from the actor's  life  kelsey grammer was born in the u.s  virgin islands where his father owned a  bar and grill called greer's place  when grammar was around two years old  his parents decided to separate and he  moved with his mom and sister to new  jersey and then florida meanwhile his  father stayed on the islands he married  someone else and fathered more children  grammar was deeply attached to his  grandfather  who raised him with the actor's mom  sadly grammar lost him when he was just  11 years old which of course turned out  to be a huge blow to him since he didn't  have a normal relationship with his  actual father  what he didn't know back then was that  he would have to endure a lot more  tragedy over the next few years  tragedy struck again in 1968 when kelsey  grammer's father frank was killed the  future actor was just 13 at the time and  his father's passing happened not long  after his grandfather's  a taxi driver named arthur b niles set  frank's car on fire and then shot him as  he ran outside  niles was described by the local news as  militantly anti-white  believed to be mentally ill and was kept  in a psychiatric ward for many years  in 1994 he was set free but ended up in  jail in 2003 when he threatened a judge  grammar didn't know about niles being  released until he read about it in a  tabloid  he later became vocal about the rights  of individuals who'd been subjected to  heinous crimes  grammar's father was a rather vocal  magazine publisher and was controversial  on the islands for his outspoken nature  his murder led to a rise in racial  tensions between the island's whites and  black residents at the time  as for grammar losing his grandfather  and dad in such a short period of time  was a lot to take in  grammar and his family went through more  heartbreak when the actor was 20 years  old  in july 1975 grammar sister karen was  kidnapped assaulted and murdered  rammer was the one who had to identify  her body my granddad on my father's side  when i called and told him about karen  he just said this family's cursed  karen's attackers were two men named  freddie glenn and michael corbett they  were found guilty and initially put on  death row a decision that was later  overturned corbett died in prison in  2019  glenn tried to seek parole several times  but grammar has blocked his attempts he  told bbc radio 4  i have learnt to forgive i have even  told the guy i forgive him although i  don't advocate his freedom i don't think  that is reasonable  the punishment shouldn't be worse for  the family than it is for the guy that  killed the person  in an interview with vanity fair grammar  reflected on this horrific experience  he revealed that he told the parole  board in 2009 that he misses karen  immensely  and that as her big brother he felt he  was supposed to protect her when he  couldn't he was gutted  kelsey grammer had to live through more  trauma when he lost two of his  half-brothers stephen and billy in a  scuba diving accident five years after  his sister's passing  when billy didn't come back to the  surface after the dive stephen went  looking for him  sadly he passed away from an embolism  probably due to an ascent gone wrong  billy was never found grammar has  acknowledged in interviews that tragedy  has been an integral part of his life  he told vanity fair every one of us is  going to experience some terrible loss  i just got a big dose for every story  you hear that's tragic  there's another that's equally tragic or  more so i think you come to look at  it as part of life kelsey grammer got  into drinking and drugs in a bid to cope  with the pain he felt from the numerous  tragedies that plagued his early life  his drinking ended up landing him in  prison in 1990 for drunk driving  in regards to this he told parade i've  been through my share of tough times i'm  a very different guy now  grammar's vices weren't limited to  alcohol and drugs  promiscuity extreme experiences and  general recklessness were all a part of  it  he has stated that he considers himself  an addictive personality and that he was  on a self-destructive path he continued  i got in too deep i probably would have  died if i hadn't stopped  luckily for grammar his frazier co-stars  knew he needed help and did everything  they could to support him they even  organized an  intervention for their friend three  years into the series while it was hard  for the rest of the show's cast  because they weren't sure what would  happen the intervention worked he  voluntarily checked into the betty ford  center in 1996 to overcome his addiction  and find a life of sobriety  when it comes to his personal  relationships drama is seemingly  unavoidable for kelsey grammer he's been  married three times and endured plenty  of heartbreak until he found peace with  his fourth wife kate walsh whom he  married in 2011.  are you happy yes  yeah grammar revealed to interviewer  graham bensinger that his third marriage  with actor camille grammer was  exhausting  when he was asked to describe any point  in a past relationship when he knew  things wouldn't work out he said  my previous marriage honestly i don't  really talk about her camille very much  because so much of her life is spent  talking about me  grammar said that after his mother  passed away his ex-wife threw a tantrum  at the funeral and started asking him to  divorce her  he said that the couple had been  involved in the same conversation for  eight long years and he was tired he  continued i realized at that moment that  i was done with her that i was not going  to end up in this relationship for much  longer and somewhere under a year i was  done  on top of that grammar's second wife an  exotic dancer named leanne suhaney was  abusive  she would insult him in public and say  hurtful things to him toward the end of  their marriage she told one of grammar's  friends  that she planned to shoot him and burn  down their house after which the actor  got a restraining order and ended the  marriage  kelsey grammer and his wife kate had  more than one miscarriage before their  kids were born grammar told the eye  newspaper  kate and i had a couple of miscarriages  before we had our first child  that was devastating these things are  hard but when it's good  it's magnificent i survived my previous  relationships just in time to land in a  place where i could be in a relationship  with a terrific person where grammar was  with leanne suhani in 1993  things were rather difficult the couple  were expecting their first child when  things took a turn for the worse rammer  had filed a restraining order against  suhani and sent her a notice demanding  an annulment  zuhani who was three months pregnant at  the time didn't take the news well  and attempted to take her own life  fortunately she was rushed to a hospital  and treated  however the pregnancy was aborted a few  days afterward grammar remarked in a  statement  i'm deeply saddened by the events  leading to the loss of the unborn child  i had dreamed of raising the baby in a  stable and loving environment  if you or anyone you know is having  suicidal thoughts please call the  national suicide prevention lifeline at  1-800-273-talk  8255 in 2008 kelsey grammer went through  a health scare when he suffered a heart  attack his publicist stan rosenfield  said at the time  rammer experienced symptoms saturday  morning after paddle boarding with his  wife camille at their hawaiian home  he added that the actor was rushed to a  hospital where doctors concluded that  he'd had a mild heart attack  in 2012 when the actor looked back at  the incident he said that he was  grateful for the experience  telling oprah it was a good thing in my  life it was the physical manifestation  of whatever lesson was being taught to  me which was you better fix it your life  now kelsey grammer's troubles have been  numerous to say the least and that  includes legal troubles  in 1995 a babysitter accused him of  assault  a charge for which a grand jury declined  to indict grammar the jury ruled that  the young woman's year plus delay in  speaking out about the incident and the  lack of physical evidence made it  difficult to back her claims  after the grand jury's decision grammar  made a statement that he was ready to  move on

